The {{glossary|noun}} is inherited from {{inh|en|enm|pelt|t=skin of a sheep, especially without the wool}};<ref>{{R:MED Online|pos=n|id=MED32791}}</ref> further etymology {{unc|en|nocap=1}}, possibly:<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''n.''{{sup|1}}|noformat=1|id=139921|date=June 2022|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|alt=pelt{{sup|2}}|pos=n}}</ref>

