## {{senseid|en|Q1115575 or Q5124673 or Q3910694 or similar}} A [[civil]] [[subdivision]] of a [[British]] [[county]], often [[corresponding]] to an earlier [[ecclesiastical]] parish; a similar subdivision in [[Ireland]].
